    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaper Actual is an Open-World Persistent Shooter where players deploy into the field as Reapers (comprised of Team 1 Operators) to engage in fast-paced FPS combat mixed with the persistence of an MMORPG. On the Island of Marova, players also will be given Bases which act as their home base for every deployment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/ddad2134f2338e6e05590c2dea3888e5.avif?t=1755121298\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can use their Base to brief &amp; restock  before they venture out on missions for and against the 5 NPC Factions that occupy Marova's infrastructure as they acquire gear and level their Reaper, weapons, and gadgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/75882accfea8f24b0c9f5a6fec373b26.avif?t=1755121298\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they complete missions, they are likely to encounter other players as hundreds deploy across the island to engage in PvPvE battles for supremacy. Each deployment, make sure to always be looking over your shoulder for whoever may be ready to take a shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/71a2900af6e3b32963287f9bd0a081fc.avif?t=1755121298\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Air, Land, and Sea vehicles at their disposal, any Reaper can find themselves in one of\u00a0 Marova's 5 different biomes with missions ranging from intense HVT missions to collecting scarce resources needed for a deep crafting system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/a19e73fb39e4be5404784f1fd183200d.avif?t=1755121298\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaper Actual is an Open-World Persistent Shooter where players deploy into the field as Reapers (comprised of Team 1 Operators) to engage in fast-paced FPS combat mixed with the persistence of an MMORPG. On the Island of Marova, players also will be given Bases which act as their home base for every deployment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/ddad2134f2338e6e05590c2dea3888e5.avif?t=1755121298\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can use their Base to brief &amp; restock  before they venture out on missions for and against the 5 NPC Factions that occupy Marova's infrastructure as they acquire gear and level their Reaper, weapons, and gadgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/75882accfea8f24b0c9f5a6fec373b26.avif?t=1755121298\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they complete missions, they are likely to encounter other players as hundreds deploy across the island to engage in PvPvE battles for supremacy. Each deployment, make sure to always be looking over your shoulder for whoever may be ready to take a shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/71a2900af6e3b32963287f9bd0a081fc.avif?t=1755121298\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Air, Land, and Sea vehicles at their disposal, any Reaper can find themselves in one of\u00a0 Marova's 5 different biomes with missions ranging from intense HVT missions to collecting scarce resources needed for a deep crafting system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/a19e73fb39e4be5404784f1fd183200d.avif?t=1755121298\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Reaper Actual is an Open-World Persistent Shooter where hundreds of players engage in FPS combat against each other and 5 NPC Factions on the massive war-torn island of Marova. Level your Reapers, maintain a home Base, and complete missions to earn gear and reshape the world.",
